{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1471493-cybele-s-generation","id":1471493,"title":"Cybele's generation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-12-30T09:34:16-08:00","id":1471493,"title":"Cybele's generation","content":"If Nergal is Cybele's Sire, she was 5th generation and committed diablerie, right?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cybele\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cybele</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3792-trueann","name":"trueann","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3792_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-30T10:26:03-08:00","id":1471494,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>trueann</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1471493-cybele-s-generation#post1471493\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Nergal is Cybele's Sire, she was 5th generation and committed diablerie, right?<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cybele\" target=\"_blank\">https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Cybele</a></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Or she <b>stayed</b> 5th gen, <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Petaniqua\" target=\"_blank\">her childe Olympias</a> diablerized her and then come up with the True Brujah cabal excuse to cover it up?<br /> Malkavians, forsworn or not, or true Baali impersonating ones, are not exactly the most reliable storytellers or sources of info....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-30T13:35:15-08:00","id":1471502,"title":"","content":"It could also be reconciled by having Nergal be the one who made her into a Baali Apostate (the Daimonion power to do this is even called the Re-Embrace).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2008-cynic01","name":"Cynic01","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"437"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-12-30T14:10:29-08:00","id":1471503,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cynic01</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1471493-cybele-s-generation?p=1471502#post1471502\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It could also be reconciled by having Nergal be the one who made her into a Baali Apostate (the Daimonion power to do this is even called the Re-Embrace).</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Supposing the face behind the &quot;Original Shaitan&quot; who build the Knossos Labyrinth - and supposedly her sire - <b>was </b>truly Nergal and not <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Shaitan#Known_Figures_Referred_to_as_Shaitan\" target=\"_blank\">someone else altogether</a>.<br /> There's at least one tale of a<a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Ba%27al#Trivia\" target=\"_blank\"> usurper that turned as darkly glorious</a> as the three mythic founders from Clanbook Baali.<br /> <br /> <br /> Clanbook Baali works from a first person perspective and the nameless medieval chronicler that pens it <i>obviously has biases, <b>beside an agenda of its own</b></i> and is far from impartial, as shown by its portrayal of Moloch and Nergal as the two poles of clan orthodoxy so to speak, with all other possible luminars either a manifestation of the elusive &quot;Third&quot; or Shaitans, usurping impostors of true Baali origin or not to be forsaken as false idols and unreliable guides. Or the fact it's called CLANbook Baali to boot. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> Caveat Emptor. Treat all of the lore as inspiration and as (un)trustworthy - specially when coming from the wiki! - as needed for the sake of one's own chronicle.<br /> <br /> <br /> PS: In my own chronicles i have considered Cybele to be the childe of the &quot;Shaitan of Knossos Labyrinth&quot;, who was <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Huitzilopochtli_(VTM)#Character_Sheet\" target=\"_blank\"><b>not</b></a> Nergal but a 4th generation Malkavian forsworn exploiting the Baali's occult lore and cult networks to advance a great working of dark bloody sorcery that would result in the making of the Cobweb, its infectious memetic spread across the whole of the clan along with the strange set of madness-wielding powers known as Dementation. So Cybele as his childe would be both Baali <b>and</b> Malkavian by way of origin, much like Petaniqua.<br /> <br /> Also, in this homebrewed version at least, Petaniqua diablerized her sire - and gets possessed by her from time to time - what serves to explain how might Cybele involve herself with the intrigue of the Punic Wars, one to two centuries after the supposed destruction of Petaniqua's sire at the time of Alexander's death as described in Kindred Most Want, among other things.<br /> <br /> <br /> Plus the &quot;13 founders of the Baali, one for each clan&quot; legendry would mutate into the idea of 13 Shaitans, one rogue methuselah from each clan that at one time or another went forsworn and then would try to assume leadership of the Baali as a whole. Beside &quot;the Shaitan of Knossos&quot; as a Malkavian forsworn, there would be Ur-Shulgi as Baal the Destroyer would be one, the elusive monster known as <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Tiamat_(VTM)?so=search\" target=\"_blank\">Tiamat</a> another, with my own version of <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Mictlantecuhtli_(VTM)?so=search\" target=\"_blank\">Mictlantecuhtli</a>, that <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Infitiore?so=search\" target=\"_blank\">has</a> some <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Harbingers_of_Skulls?so=search\" target=\"_blank\">major divergences</a> from canon, as a fourth one.<br /> <br /> Others are open for when a passing fancy to garble with some bit of canon lore strikes me, that was the whole point behind making Shaitans of my own from Tiamat &amp; &quot;Mictlan as big grandaddy of the Harbingers as Baali-infitiores&quot;, it's a great springboard to go crazy with the lore and NPCs.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1147,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","user":"Baaldam","date":". 01-03-2022, 12:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}